<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>[FusionChart] 차트 타입을 스크립트로 변경하기 - Scroll Single Series, Scroll Stacked</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_782aee1cf5f305d4" class="chapter_title">[FusionChart] 차트 타입을 스크립트로 변경하기 - Scroll Single Series, Scroll Stacked</h1><h1 id="r_93f1e6510f568e44" class="element heading1" data-element-id="93f1e6510f568e44"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_d5d7dd8848ee26b1" class="element pre" data-element-id="d5d7dd8848ee26b1">Fusionchart의 'Scroll Single Series', 'Scroll Stacked' 타입을 확인할 수 있는 예제입니다.
차트의 타입은 'changeType' 메소드를 사용하여 설정할 수 있습니다.</pre><div id="r_25d53ca6cf812b5c" class="element note" data-element-id="25d53ca6cf812b5c"><p>이 예제의 Fusion Chart 버전은 3.19입니다.</p><p>FusionChart 가이드 : <a class="link" href="https://www.fusioncharts.com/dev/fusioncharts">https://www.fusioncharts.com/dev/fusioncharts</a></p><p>FusionChart의 타입 목록 : <a class="link" href="https://www.fusioncharts.com/dev/chart-guide/list-of-charts/">https://www.fusioncharts.com/dev/chart-guide/list-of-charts/</a></p></div><p id="r_f9b99e8104a683f1" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="f9b99e8104a683f1"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00310">P00310</a></p><h1 id="r_817ccb5ba8e320ac" class="element heading1" data-element-id="817ccb5ba8e320ac"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_dfa474063b7a2f70" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="dfa474063b7a2f70"><li><p>스크립트로 'Scroll Single Series Charts' 타입의 차트 변경하기</p></li><li><p>스크립트로 'Scroll Stacked Charts' 타입의 차트 변경하기</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_1355350b5c1b521a" class="element heading1" data-element-id="1355350b5c1b521a"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_4575d98c3a8ff1cc" class="element heading2" data-element-id="4575d98c3a8ff1cc"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>스크립트로 'Scroll Single Series Charts' 타입의 차트 변경하기</span></div></h2><pre id="r_beb43927531dba1e" class="element pre" data-element-id="beb43927531dba1e">'Scroll Single Series Charts' 영역의 Radio에 변경할 수 있는 차트 타입이 구성되어 있습니다. 항목을 선택(클릭)하면 차트 타입이 변경됩니다.</pre><div id="r_64dd9e0a2907c15f" class="element step1" data-element-id="64dd9e0a2907c15f"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>CASE 1. 'Scroll Column 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_59f8b9b4761d5fb2" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="59f8b9b4761d5fb2"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Scroll Column 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image470.png" width="378" height="378" /></p></div><div id="r_4d6fe2c351bffd2b" class="element step1" data-element-id="4d6fe2c351bffd2b"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>CASE 2. 'Scroll Bar 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_f214fc113d302eaf" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="f214fc113d302eaf"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Scroll Bar 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image471.png" width="378" height="378" /></p></div><div id="r_fb88bfb0b73d1d02" class="element step1" data-element-id="fb88bfb0b73d1d02"><p class="step1_n">3</p><p>CASE 3. 'Scroll Line 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_b6e349d4490117e4" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="b6e349d4490117e4"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 3.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Scroll Line 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image472.png" width="378" height="378" /></p></div><div id="r_9cd888c0c4e3cb00" class="element step1" data-element-id="9cd888c0c4e3cb00"><p class="step1_n">4</p><p>CASE 4. 'Scroll Area 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_349effaa715d2117" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="349effaa715d2117"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 4.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Scroll Area 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image473.png" width="378" height="378" /></p></div><h2 id="r_1590998b38e55a74" class="element heading2" data-element-id="1590998b38e55a74"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.2</span><span>스크립트로 'Scroll Stacked Charts' 타입의 차트 변경하기</span></div></h2><pre id="r_5dfa6bc6e192eeb2" class="element pre" data-element-id="5dfa6bc6e192eeb2">'Scroll Stacked Charts' 영역의 Radio에 변경할 수 있는 차트 타입이 구성되어 있습니다. 항목을 선택(클릭)하면 차트 타입이 변경됩니다.</pre><div id="r_b0dbf73ae87992ae" class="element step1" data-element-id="b0dbf73ae87992ae"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>CASE 1. 'Scroll Stacked Column 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_29625b7a31a39eeb" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="29625b7a31a39eeb"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 5.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Scroll Stacked Column 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image474.png" width="378" height="378" /></p></div><div id="r_894212f54e51c22e" class="element step1" data-element-id="894212f54e51c22e"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>CASE 2. 'Scroll Stacked Bar 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_42642cfb8273caea" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="42642cfb8273caea"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 6.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Scroll Stacked Bar 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image475.png" width="378" height="378" /></p></div><h1 id="r_fccd6d1347c6ba14" class="element heading1" data-element-id="fccd6d1347c6ba14"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_e3c860c4dc3c3abc" class="element heading2" data-element-id="e3c860c4dc3c3abc"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>스크립트로 'Scroll Single Series Charts' 타입의 차트 변경하기</span></div></h2><p id="r_ec8d8984c80b6955" class="element normal" data-element-id="ec8d8984c80b6955">FusionChart의 'changeType' 메소드를 사용하여 스크립트를 작성합니다.</p><div id="r_6c5b78ecbe5d8ea6" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="6c5b78ecbe5d8ea6"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// 'Scroll Single Series Charts' 타입 변경 예시)</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fucionchart의 속성 'seriesColumns' 예시) [['zone1']]</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Scroll Column 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'scrollcolumn2d'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Scroll Bar 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'scrollbar2d'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Scroll Line 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'scrollline2d'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Scroll Area 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'scrollarea2d'</span>);</pre></div><div id="r_793eb3f3b14511a8" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="793eb3f3b14511a8"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 2.</span>Source</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;w2:fusionchart <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">chartType</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"ScrollColumn2D"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"cht_exam1"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;labelNode</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"type"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">seriesColumns</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"[['zone1']]"</span><span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;drawType</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"javascript"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">ref</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"data:dlt_chartData_1"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;/w2:fusionchart&gt;</pre></div><div id="r_9fc2d33f1682f987" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="9fc2d33f1682f987"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 3.</span>DataList 'dlt_chartData_1'의 JSON 유형의 데이터</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>[
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"T1"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone1"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"22350"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone2"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"25420"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone3"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"24560"</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;},
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"T2"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone1"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"15740"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone2"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"26950"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone3"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"10140"</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;},
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"T3"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone1"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"22580"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone2"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"16550"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone3"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"21070"</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>]</pre></div><h2 id="r_4513e5f4f44d402d" class="element heading2" data-element-id="4513e5f4f44d402d"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.2</span><span>스크립트로 'Scroll Stacked Charts' 타입의 차트 변경하기</span></div></h2><p id="r_a70568bc4a17152f" class="element normal" data-element-id="a70568bc4a17152f">FusionChart의 'changeType' 메소드를 사용하여 스크립트를 작성합니다.</p><div id="r_99ae96843bd2656a" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="99ae96843bd2656a"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 4.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// 'Scroll Stacked Charts' 타입 변경 예시)</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fucionchart의 속성 'seriesColumns' 예시) [['zone1','zone2','zone3']]</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam2'의 차트 타입을 'Scroll Stacked Column 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>cht_exam2.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'scrollstackedcolumn2d'</span>);
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam2'의 차트 타입을 'Scroll Stacked Bar 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>cht_exam2.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'scrollstackedbar2d'</span>);</pre></div><div id="r_f1ab36a44048ba49" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="f1ab36a44048ba49"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 5.</span>Source</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;w2:fusionchart <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">chartType</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"ScrollStackedColumn2D"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"cht_exam2"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;labelNode</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"type"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">seriesColumns</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"[['zone1','zone2','zone3']]"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;drawType</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"javascript"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">ref</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"data:dlt_chartData_1"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;/w2:fusionchart&gt;</pre></div><div id="r_87c53cd603aaead7" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="87c53cd603aaead7"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 6.</span>DataList 'dlt_chartData_1'의 JSON 유형의 데이터</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>[
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"T1"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone1"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"22350"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone2"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"25420"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone3"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"24560"</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;},
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"T2"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone1"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"15740"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone2"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"26950"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone3"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"10140"</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;},
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"T3"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone1"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"22580"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone2"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"16550"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"zone3"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"21070"</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>]</pre></div><h1 id="r_478cd0206a5c123d" class="element heading1" data-element-id="478cd0206a5c123d"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_0469b82d63c88e49" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="0469b82d63c88e49"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_method_span">chartType ( chartType )</span> </p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_method_span">setChartAttribute( options )</span></p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_method_span">draw( )</span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>